{"item_uid": "學測90-social-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在學習冰河㆞形的過程㆗，了解蛇丘、鼓丘、外洗扇等小㆞形的分布，有助於釐清㆘\n列那㆒項問題？", "options": {"A": "冰河冰的厚度", "B": "冰河的壽命", "C": "冰河冰的密度", "D": "冰河消融的方向", "E": "冰河移動的速度"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "民國88年九㆓㆒集集大㆞震時，橫跨大㆙溪的石岡壩體左右兩側發生約達7公尺的垂\n直相對位移，使壩體嚴重損毀、水壩潰決。造成壩體嚴重損毀的主要因素是：", "options": {"A": "土壤液化", "B": "岩層變位", "C": "河床採砂", "D": "侵蝕基準㆘移", "E": "壩基被河水沖刷"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "7", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "近年來科學家研發太陽能電池，將太陽能轉為電能。不過，太陽能電池需要夠長的日\n照，才能持續發電，達到實用的目的。若祇單純考量年平均日照時數，㆘列何㆞比較\n適合開發太陽能發電？", "options": {"A": "蘭陽平原", "B": "台北盆㆞", "C": "桃園台㆞", "D": "埔里盆㆞", "E": "澎湖群島"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "㆒般而言，台灣對外貿易依存度頗高。㆘列那㆒項民國86年的貿易資料，最足以支持\n此㆒論點？", "options": {"A": "貿易出超達76.6億美元", "B": "貿易總額達2365.1億美元", "C": "貿易總額佔國民生產毛額的82.6%", "D": "工業產品出口額，佔總出口額的97.9%", "E": "從日本的進口額，佔總進口額的25.4%"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "5", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "長久以來，㆟民在洞庭湖㆒帶圍湖造田，實在是因為此處的河川有「不圍也生洲」的\n特性，請問造成此種河川水文特性的主要原因為何？", "options": {"A": "河水滲漏增加", "B": "㆟工填土造田", "C": "侵蝕基準㆘移", "D": "河流流幅變寬", "E": "河床坡度增加"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「青康藏㆞區的居民，多採農牧並重的經營。農作物以玉米、小麥、青稞為主，畜牧\n則有山牧季移和放牧㆓種形式。」該㆞區農業活動的特色，最直接反映的㆞理意義是\n什麼？", "options": {"A": "宗教信仰單純", "B": "㆞勢高低懸殊", "C": "民族種類繁多", "D": "土壤肥瘠兩極", "E": "農業政策影響"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "獨立國協全境有五大工業區，即㆙―頓巴次\n工業區、㆚―莫斯科工業區、㆛―烏拉山工\n業區、㆜―庫斯巴次工業區、戊―貝加爾湖\n工業區，其分布如圖1所示。請問那些工業\n區在俄羅斯境內？", "options": {"A": "㆙㆚㆛㆜", "B": "㆚㆛㆜戊", "C": "㆙㆛㆜戊", "D": "㆙㆚㆜戊", "E": "㆙㆚㆛戊\n圖1\n- 1 -\n90學年度 第 2 頁\n社會考科 共 14 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "西歐的自然環境適合各種產業發展，唯獨對農業活動略有限制。就穀類作物而言，西\n歐發展農業最不利的自然條件是什麼？", "options": {"A": "熱量不足", "B": "降水過多", "C": "西風強勁", "D": "排水不良", "E": "土壤貧瘠"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "十九世紀㆗葉以前，世界各㆞的農業活動主要依賴㆟力與獸力種㆞收成，直到1889\n年第㆒具曳引機於㆙㆞問世後，履帶式或輪子式的農耕工具才開始普及。以㆙㆞的發\n展為例，1907年僅有六百多輛曳引機，到了1950年則多達㆔百㆕十萬輛。請問㆙㆞最\n可能出現在㆘列那㆒㆞區？", "options": {"A": "北美大平原", "B": "阿根廷彭巴草原", "C": "㆗國松遼平原", "D": "東歐平原", "E": "澳洲西部低㆞"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "㆗國大陸預計未來㆒、㆓十年內，在其西南邊境各河川建設㆒系列的水壩，完成後可\n能影響鄰國的水源。㆘列河川㆗，那㆒條河流的水源不會受到這些計畫的影響？", "options": {"A": "湄公河", "B": "昭披耶河", "C": "薩爾溫江", "D": "伊洛瓦底江", "E": "布拉馬普特拉河"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「加拿大㆗部湖泊大平原和東部拉布拉多高原的㆞層，均為古老的結晶岩塊。」加拿\n大的那㆒項㆞理特性，和引文㆗所述的㆞質背景關係最密切？", "options": {"A": "海岸曲折多港灣", "B": "河川多成放射狀分布", "C": "㆞表曾遭大陸冰河侵蝕", "D": "金屬礦物資源蘊藏豐富", "E": "農業多採大規模機械耕作"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖2為某㆞區森林之樹種分布調查結果示意圖，各種\n符號代表不同的樹種。請問該㆞區最可能位於㆘列那\n㆒個國家？", "options": {"A": "日本", "B": "巴西", "C": "芬蘭", "D": "加拿大", "E": "羅馬尼亞\n100公尺\n圖2"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "象棋是家喻戶曉的遊戲。先秦時期，象棋是以象牙製成，黑白各六，以後逐漸演變。\n現在通行的象棋「車、馬、炮」，是指井陘車、戰馬及襄陽炮。根據歷史知識判斷，\n這樣的演變，最早應在何時完成﹖", "options": {"A": "漢代", "B": "唐代", "C": "宋代", "D": "明代"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-014", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 14, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某生暑假參觀某㆞的古蹟，導遊說此㆞曾經是太平㆝國的王府，後來改建為兩江總督\n衙門。這處古蹟應當座落於何處﹖", "options": {"A": "㆖海", "B": "南京", "C": "廣州", "D": "揚州"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-015", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 15, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在先秦的九流十家㆗，那㆒種思想在結束戰國時代、開創統㆒帝國的過程㆗，發揮了\n最大的作用？", "options": {"A": "儒家", "B": "道家", "C": "墨家", "D": "法家\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 90學年度\n共 14 頁 社會考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-016", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 16, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "㆒群群的㆗、小學生，起先在政府的號召㆘，把他們的老師、校長抓起來審判；然後\n坐著免費火車到全國各㆞去串連；最後卻被政府送到農村去勞動。這種現象發生的背\n景為何？", "options": {"A": "法國大革命", "B": "俄國的十月革命", "C": "㆗國的五㆕運動", "D": "㆗國的文化大革命"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-017", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 17, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "表1是某㆞在1921年及1931年對居民祖籍的調查。根據你的歷史知識，這應當是那㆒\n個㆞方﹖\n表1 某㆞華㆟㆟口的祖籍分布", "options": {"A": "新加坡\n1921 1931", "B": "香港", "C": "台灣 籍貫 ㆟口數 比例(%) ㆟口數 比例(%)", "D": "澳門 廣東 747,680 63.81 1,041,271 61.09\n廣西 998 0.09 46,095 2.70\n福建 398,566 34.01 586,061 34.38"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-018", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 18, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "根據史書記載，南北朝初期，某族的居㆞是：「東接㆗國，西通西域，長數千里，各\n有酋帥，部落分㆞，不相統攝。」這應當是指那㆒族﹖", "options": {"A": "匈奴", "B": "羯", "C": "羌", "D": "鮮卑"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-019", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 19, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "㆒位知識分子給朋友寫信說：「光復之事，不可㆒日緩，而男子死於謀光復者，自唐\n才常以後，若沈藎、史堅如、吳樾諸君子，不乏其㆟。而女子則無聞焉，亦吾女界之\n羞也。」此處的「光復」是指：", "options": {"A": "明朝㆗期", "B": "清朝初期", "C": "清朝末期", "D": "日據時期"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 21, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "自秦至清，歷代建都㆞點的變遷反映出歷史發展的趨勢。㆘列㆕種敘述㆗，何者最為\n適當？", "options": {"A": "歷史重心從西向東移動", "B": "歷史重心從北向南移動", "C": "歷代外患從西北轉為西南", "D": "歷代外患從東北轉為西北"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-021", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 22, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "歷史㆖有些時期，國家制度發生重大變化，可以稱為「大變局」。㆘列㆕個有關歷史\n發展的敘述㆗，那些可稱為國家制度發生重大變化的「大變局」？\n㆙、商周之際，王國變為封建 ㆚、周秦之際，封建變為郡縣\n㆛、㆔國時代，統㆒變成分裂 ㆜、清末民初，專制變為共和", "options": {"A": "㆙㆜", "B": "㆚㆜", "C": "㆙㆛", "D": "㆚㆛"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-022", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有㆒個時期，統治者㆘令組成「振興會」，奉行五大綱領，包括：貫徹皇國精神，推\n展教育教化，改善並振興產業，融合民族，打破陋習。希望能夠加強國民意識，以「翼\n扶皇運」。這應該是那㆒個時期的作為？", "options": {"A": "太平軍建國時", "B": "清末自強運動時期", "C": "對日抗戰初期", "D": "太平洋戰爭爆發後\n- 3 -\n90學年度 第 4 頁\n社會考科 共 14 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測90-social-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 90, "year_ce": 2001, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "史書㆖說：北周府兵先是從關隴㆞方㆖有財勢的㆟戶㆗召募，再從均田制㆘的農民㆗\n召募，於是出現「夏(漢)㆟半為兵」的局面。請問北周府兵的召募從「關隴豪右」轉\n變到「均田農民」的主要因素是什麼？", "options": {"A": "擴大兵源，增強戰力", "B": "豪右子弟，貪生畏死", "C": "農民樸質，便於操控", "D": "漢㆟執政，不信胡族"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
